'''Quick-Grow Extract''' (Japanese: '''そうじゅくエキス''' ''Precocious Extract'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Crimson Blaze}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=Choose 1 of your {{e|Grass}} Pokémon in play. Put a random {{e|Grass}} Pokémon from your deck that evolves from that Pokémon onto that Pokémon to evolve it. You can't use this card during your first turn or on a Pokémon that was put into play this turn.
}}

